              "level": 0,
              "text": "If a retained testis is removed and a descended testis preserved, the ethical considerations of using the animal for breeding and potential for hereditary cryptorchidism should be impressed upon owner. Bilateral orchiectomy is the most commonly recommended course of treatment in literature reports.",
